WEBVTT

00:12:29.787 --> 00:12:32.623
I have to say: hopefully never.

00:12:35.167 --> 00:12:36.418
Thank you.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.795
(Applause)

00:12:41.715 --> 00:12:44.676
Helen Walters: Thank you.
Thank you so much. Thank you.

00:12:46.345 --> 00:12:49.014
So you talked about trust in that --

00:12:49.056 --> 00:12:52.518
and we've seen the vaccine rate,
when it's available,

00:12:52.518 --> 00:12:54.019
it's really shockingly low,

00:12:54.019 --> 00:12:56.730
and much of that
is really related to trust,

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:59.942
trust in the systems, trust in society.

00:12:59.942 --> 00:13:04.404
What are ways that you think
that we can do a better job as a society